---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PhonePreview from '../components/PhonePreview.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <Nav />

  <!-- ================== HERO ================== -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="tag"><span class="tag-dot"></span>Now in beta · iOS + Android</span>
      <h1 class="display">Reply faster.<br />Win more jobs.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Foremann is a business phone number that writes your reply for you,
        in your voice. The job goes to you, not the guy who answered first.
        Built for plumbers, electricians, HVAC techs, landscapers, and
        anyone running their own shop.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#" data-waitlist class="btn btn-primary">Get your business number</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">No contracts · Cancel anytime · Beta pricing locked in · Setup in 5 minutes</div>
    </div>

    <div class="preview">
      <PhonePreview />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== PROBLEM ================== -->
  <section class="alt" id="problem">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">The problem</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">You're the owner, the crew, and the foreman.<br />Something has to give. Usually it's the phone.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Every contractor we've talked to has the same three problems.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">01</div>
          <h3>The three-hour reply</h3>
          <p>You see the text after the job wraps up. By then she's already hired the other guy who answered in ten minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <h3>The dropped follow-up</h3>
          <p>You quoted the deck rebuild two weeks ago and never heard back. You meant to check in. You didn't. That's a job you didn't get.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">03</div>
          <h3>The 10pm text</h3>
          <p>Clients have your cell. Your partner is sick of it. There's no off switch between work and home.</p>
          <p class="card-note">Foremann doesn't answer it for you. It writes your reply and holds it until morning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== HOW IT WORKS ================== -->
  <section id="how">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">How it works</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">We set up your foreman in five minutes.<br />You win jobs the same day.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>We get you a business phone line</h3>
          <p>Pick an area code. We buy the number and set it up. Your clients text it. Your personal phone never rings for work again.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>We make it sound like you</h3>
          <p>Tell us your trade, your service area, and how you talk. We train your foreman to sound like you, not a chatbot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>Send in thirty seconds</h3>
          <p>Every text that comes in has a reply ready. Tap edit or tap send. You're out the door before the other guy wakes up.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== FEATURES ================== -->
  <section class="ink-section" id="features">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">What your foreman does</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">A second pair of hands that never takes a day off.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">

        <!-- Lead Sources -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-lead-source">
              <span class="fv-lead-badge">Angi lead</span>
              <span class="fv-lead-job">Deck repair · Phoenix, AZ</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-ai">
              <span class="fv-ai-label">Draft ready · 8 seconds</span>
              <span class="fv-ai-msg">Hey, I do deck repair in Phoenix. Can come take a look this week. What days work?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num feat-coming">Lead sources</div>
          <h3>First reply on Angi, Yelp, and Thumbtack. Every time.</h3>
          <p>Forward your lead emails to Foremann. Your foreman reads the lead and writes the first message before the other guy has typed "Hello."</p>
          <span class="feat-tag">Coming next</span>
        </div>

        <!-- AI Draft -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-bubble fv-in">Any chance you can do next Tuesday?</div>
            <div class="fv-ai">
              <span class="fv-ai-label">AI Draft</span>
              <span class="fv-ai-msg">Tuesday works. I can be there by 8. Does that work?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">AI Draft</div>
          <h3>A reply ready on every text</h3>
          <p>Your foreman reads the thread and writes a response that sounds like you sent it. You review, tweak, hit send. Most contractors are out in under ten seconds.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Follow-ups -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-bubble fv-out">Sent you the quote, let me know!</div>
            <div class="fv-gap">3 days · no reply</div>
            <div class="fv-ai">
              <span class="fv-ai-label">Follow-up ready</span>
              <span class="fv-ai-msg">Hey, wanted to check in on that quote. Any questions?</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Follow-ups</div>
          <h3>Quotes don't go cold.</h3>
          <p>When a client hasn't replied in a couple days, your foreman writes a check-in. One missed follow-up can be the difference between a paid week and a slow one.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Summaries -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-sum-label">Client Summary</div>
            <div class="fv-sum-row">
              <span class="fv-sum-name">Tom Braxton</span>
              <span class="fv-sum-meta">14 jobs · $5,200</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-sum-text">Wants gutters cleaned before rain season. Quoted $180. Waiting on his schedule. Prefers weekend mornings.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Summaries</div>
          <h3>Long threads at a glance</h3>
          <p>Two sentences that tell you who the client is, what they want, and what to do next. No more scrolling back to remember.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Your voice -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual">
            <div class="fv-compare">
              <div>
                <div class="fv-compare-label">Generic AI</div>
                <div class="fv-bubble fv-out fv-dull">Hello, I will be available on Friday afternoon.</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="fv-compare-label active">Your foreman</div>
                <div class="fv-bubble fv-out">Friday works. I'll be there around 2. See you then 👍</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Your voice</div>
          <h3>Trained on how you talk</h3>
          <p>Formality, length, phrases you always use, phrases you'd never use. Your foreman matches you. Doesn't make you sound like a robot.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Text-only line -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual fv-call">
            <div class="fv-call-icon">📵</div>
            <div class="fv-call-num">(415) 555-0182 · calling...</div>
            <div class="fv-call-redirect">"Please text this number instead. We'll get back to you shortly."</div>
            <div class="fv-call-badge">Auto-redirected</div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Text-only line</div>
          <h3>Callers get told to text instead</h3>
          <p>Anyone who calls hears "please text this number instead." Your phone doesn't ring. Your day doesn't get interrupted. Smart call handling coming next.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Work / life -->
        <div class="card feat-card">
          <div class="feat-visual" style="justify-content:center;gap:10px;">
            <div class="fv-line">
              <div class="fv-line-icon">💼</div>
              <div class="fv-line-info">
                <div class="fv-line-label">Business line</div>
                <div class="fv-line-num">(720) 555-0191</div>
              </div>
              <div class="fv-line-badge on">Active</div>
            </div>
            <div class="fv-divider"></div>
            <div class="fv-line">
              <div class="fv-line-icon">🔒</div>
              <div class="fv-line-info">
                <div class="fv-line-label">Personal number</div>
                <div class="fv-line-num">Never shared</div>
              </div>
              <div class="fv-line-badge">Private</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="num">Work / life</div>
          <h3>Clean separation from day one</h3>
          <p>Clients only have the business number. Nothing hits your personal phone. Notifications off when you want them off.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== ROADMAP PEEK ================== -->
  <section class="alt" id="next">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow-muted">What's next</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Starting with the phone.<br />Ending with everything else.</h2>
        <p class="lede">
          We start with the phone because that's where you're losing the most
          money right now. But a real foreman handles more than texts, and so
          will yours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Now</div>
          <h3>Texts, AI drafts, follow-ups</h3>
          <p>Every inbound text arrives with a ready-to-send reply in your voice. Stale threads get surfaced before they go cold.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">Next</div>
          <h3>Calls and voicemail</h3>
          <p>Your foreman answers when you can't. Takes a message, writes down what they want, writes the callback or text. You see it when you get off the ladder.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="num">After</div>
          <h3>Scheduling, quotes, invoices</h3>
          <p>From the same thread that booked the job, your foreman puts the date on the calendar, writes the quote, sends the invoice when the work is done.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== TESTIMONIALS ================== -->
  <section id="testimonials">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">What contractors are saying</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Words from the field.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid testimonial-grid">
        <div class="card testimonial-card">
          <p class="testimonial-quote">"I used to take forever to text people back because I'm always on a job. Now I see the draft and hit send in ten seconds. Closed two jobs I probably would've lost."</p>
          <div class="testimonial-attr">
            <div class="testimonial-name">Mike</div>
            <div class="testimonial-trade">Electrician · Austin, TX</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card testimonial-card">
          <p class="testimonial-quote">"The follow-up thing is what got me. I quoted a deck rebuild and forgot about it. Two weeks later Foremann reminded me to text the guy. He said 'glad you followed up' and booked the job."</p>
          <div class="testimonial-attr">
            <div class="testimonial-name">Jason</div>
            <div class="testimonial-trade">General Contractor · Denver, CO</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card testimonial-card">
          <p class="testimonial-quote">"My wife kept asking why clients were texting me at 10pm. Now they have the business number. Problem solved."</p>
          <div class="testimonial-attr">
            <div class="testimonial-name">Carlos</div>
            <div class="testimonial-trade">HVAC Tech · Phoenix, AZ</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== PRICING ================== -->
  <section id="pricing">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Priced like a tool, not a phone bill.</h2>
        <p class="lede">One job pays for a month. Lock in your rate. Cancel anytime.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing">
        <div class="price-card">
          <div class="price-name">Solo</div>
          <div class="price-persona">Running your own jobs.</div>
          <div>
            <span class="price-amount">$29</span>
            <span class="price-period">/ mo</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li>One business number</li>
            <li>200 AI draft replies / month</li>
            <li>Unlimited inbound SMS</li>
            <li>iOS + Android apps</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" data-waitlist class="btn btn-secondary price-cta">Get your business number</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card featured">
          <div class="price-badge">Most popular</div>
          <div class="price-name">Active</div>
          <div class="price-persona">Busy enough that every lead counts.</div>
          <div>
            <span class="price-amount">$69</span>
            <span class="price-period">/ mo</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li>Everything in Solo</li>
            <li>600 AI draft replies / month</li>
            <li>AI conversation summaries</li>
            <li>Smart follow-up suggestions</li>
            <li>Priority support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" data-waitlist class="btn btn-primary price-cta">Get your business number</a>
        </div>

        <div class="price-card">
          <div class="price-name">Crew</div>
          <div class="price-persona">Multiple guys on the same phone line.</div>
          <div>
            <span class="price-amount">$229</span>
            <span class="price-period">/ mo</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="price-features">
            <li>Up to 5 contractors</li>
            <li>2,000 AI draft replies / month</li>
            <li>Shared inbox</li>
            <li>Admin dashboard</li>
            <li>Priority support</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#" data-waitlist class="btn btn-secondary price-cta">Get your business number</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== FAQ ================== -->
  <section class="alt" id="faq">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Common questions</div>
        <h2 class="heading-xl">Good questions deserve straight answers.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Does the AI text my clients automatically?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>No. You always review before anything sends. The AI writes a reply in your voice. You read it, edit if needed, and hit send. Your clients always hear from you, not a bot.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">What if the draft doesn't sound right?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>Edit it before sending. It's a starting point, not an autopilot. The more you fill in your AI profile (how you talk, words you use, words you'd never say), the better the drafts get. Most contractors are sending drafts on day one.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Do I keep my current phone number?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>You get a second business number. Foremann doesn't replace your personal number. Clients only have the business line. Your personal phone stays clean.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Does it work on Android?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>Yes. iOS and Android both. Download the Foremann app and sign up. Your number is set up inside the app in about five minutes.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">What happens when I hit my monthly limit?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            <p>You get a push notification at 80% so you're not surprised. If you hit the cap, AI drafting pauses. You can still send and receive texts normally. Upgrade anytime mid-month and the limit resets right away.</p>
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================== FINAL CTA ================== -->
  <section class="big-cta" id="get">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Beta open now</div>
      <h2 class="display">Reply faster.<br />Win more jobs.</h2>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a href="#" data-waitlist class="btn btn-primary">Get your business number</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
